<Site title="Terms" description="Terms for Counted’s election data, civic tools, AI chat and Coalition Chaos game.">
  <div class="page-top page-share-heading"><h1>Terms</h1><PageShare/></div>
  <article class="card terms">
    <p class="small">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-11-07">7 November 2026</time></p>
    <p>Counted is an independent civic project operated by Jacques Blom. These terms apply to the website, API, data tools, Ask Counted and Coalition Chaos. Please read them before using the service, together with our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>. By using Counted, you agree to these terms, subject to your rights under mandatory law.</p>
    <aside class="terms-notice" aria-labelledby="terms-notice-heading">
      <h2 id="terms-notice-heading">Please read before relying on Counted</h2>
      <p>Information can be incomplete, inaccurate or out of date. Coalition Chaos contains fictional scenarios and satire. Check important information with the linked sources. The <a href="#liability">liability limits below</a> affect the losses you may recover, but do not remove rights or remedies that the law protects.</p>
